(1425307, 183623, 31213, '<td valign="top">Out of focus...a stretch that probably wont score high.  The fact is, this looks like a poorly planned snapshot.  <br/> <br/>Lighting- poor<br/>Composition- poor<br/>Focus- poor<br/>Image Quality- poor (grainy due to high ISO probably)<br/> <br/> <br/>I''m not trying to be mean, and I know that my comments probably seem blunt and unhelpful but I dont mean for it to be that way.  I like your idea but I feel the execution is poor.  If the title is "Up or Down" than the fingers on the control should be the primary focal point.....and theya re out of focus!  Maybe a macro close-up on the thumb pushing against the stick would have been more dramatic and effective.<br/> <br/>Goodluck!<br/> <br/>Chris</td>', 'Out of focus...a stretch that probably wont score high.  The fact is, this looks like a poorly planned snapshot.   Lighting- poorComposition- poorFocus- poorImage Quality- poor (grainy due to high ISO probably)  I''m not trying to be mean, and I know that my comments probably seem blunt and unhelpful but I dont mean for it to be that way.  I like your idea but I feel the execution is poor.  If the title is "Up or Down" than the fingers on the control should be the primary focal point.....and theya re out of focus!  Maybe a macro close-up on the thumb pushing against the stick would have been more dramatic and effective. Goodluck! Chris', '2005-06-01 05:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
