(1425329, 182923, 37382, '<td valign="top">Love it.  Got to be one of life''s toughest decisions.  Well captured and made my emotions run high.  One thing though - a woman will rarely write in capitals - and I''m guessing it has to be a woman from the wedding/enagement ring?</td>', 'Love it.  Got to be one of life''s toughest decisions.  Well captured and made my emotions run high.  One thing though - a woman will rarely write in capitals - and I''m guessing it has to be a woman from the wedding/enagement ring?', '2005-06-01 05:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
