(1425337, 183695, 35720, '<td valign="top">For me this is not a photo of a decision, because the boy has to choose between two possibilities and hasn''t made his decision.  But if he had already made his decision and were walking one of those two paths in the photo it would be a photo of a decision IMHO. Nice shot though!</td>', 'For me this is not a photo of a decision, because the boy has to choose between two possibilities and hasn''t made his decision.  But if he had already made his decision and were walking one of those two paths in the photo it would be a photo of a decision IMHO. Nice shot though!', '2005-06-01 05:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
