(1426129, 182296, 27482, '<td valign="top">No offense intended but if I may be honest this is a poor choice of DOF.  Either it should be shallower and keep tha man a big blur or deeper and include the man in the focus.  As it is he is irritatingly out of focus and he draws way too much attention relative to the hand and the ring.  Anyway, I don´t dislike this shot at all, think it´s pretty good but for me personally the DOF doens´t work here, just my opinion though.</td>', 'No offense intended but if I may be honest this is a poor choice of DOF.  Either it should be shallower and keep tha man a big blur or deeper and include the man in the focus.  As it is he is irritatingly out of focus and he draws way too much attention relative to the hand and the ring.  Anyway, I don´t dislike this shot at all, think it´s pretty good but for me personally the DOF doens´t work here, just my opinion though.', '2005-06-01 12:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
