(1426687, 183732, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh this is great.  I love how the cupcake is all sharp, colorful and beautiful right before your eyes, and the apple is dull and blurry in the background.    That''s about the size of the decision I''d probably make  :)</td>', 'Oh this is great.  I love how the cupcake is all sharp, colorful and beautiful right before your eyes, and the apple is dull and blurry in the background.    That''s about the size of the decision I''d probably make  :)', '2005-06-01 16:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
