(1427103, 182919, 8377, '<td valign="top">I love this photo! It''s kind of funny cause all the ties are almost hte same, but you have to pick a color! I choose the gold. :) Good clarity, excellent idea. One of my favs in the challenge.</td>', 'I love this photo! It''s kind of funny cause all the ties are almost hte same, but you have to pick a color! I choose the gold. :) Good clarity, excellent idea. One of my favs in the challenge.', '2005-06-01 18:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
