(1427128, 184028, 33732, '<td valign="top">You had the idea I had which was what photo decision to make.  Thanks.  And the sky and water are so perfect.  High score for this.</td>', 'You had the idea I had which was what photo decision to make.  Thanks.  And the sky and water are so perfect.  High score for this.', '2005-06-01 18:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
