(1427224, 184025, 30817, '<td valign="top">Nice storytelling here. If the mirror had been cleaned beforehand, I feel it would have been a plus for the sophisticated nature of the shot.</td>', 'Nice storytelling here. If the mirror had been cleaned beforehand, I feel it would have been a plus for the sophisticated nature of the shot.', '2005-06-01 19:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
