(1427523, 182312, 28261, '<td valign="top">This image suffers greatly from a reddish and yellow cast that some white balancing might correct.  That said I see a row of young adults, with a distracting bar in front of them and all are out of focus so as to make them seem unimportant.  Nowhere except the title do I see a link to a story that speaks of decision or decision making although I do see a story about boredom and another of distraction.  The background action appears to be a food court of some kind which adds to the confusion in the whole.  This concept (do I keep listening) would have been better illustrated to this viewer from the view of a one-on-one adult chastising and indignant adolescent.  I can only offer a 2 to this image based on confusing elements, technical blur and an extremely weak challenge link.</td>', 'This image suffers greatly from a reddish and yellow cast that some white balancing might correct.  That said I see a row of young adults, with a distracting bar in front of them and all are out of focus so as to make them seem unimportant.  Nowhere except the title do I see a link to a story that speaks of decision or decision making although I do see a story about boredom and another of distraction.  The background action appears to be a food court of some kind which adds to the confusion in the whole.  This concept (do I keep listening) would have been better illustrated to this viewer from the view of a one-on-one adult chastising and indignant adolescent.  I can only offer a 2 to this image based on confusing elements, technical blur and an extremely weak challenge link.', '2005-06-01 21:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
