(1427606, 183655, 31211, '<td valign="top">Great, great catch! Perfect humouriistic shot. I could live without the yellow border, but very good in every other aspect. Good job.</td>', 'Great, great catch! Perfect humouriistic shot. I could live without the yellow border, but very good in every other aspect. Good job.', '2005-06-01 22:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
