(1427621, 184012, 30817, '<td valign="top">There is a painting like this in the Dayton Art Institute in Dayton, Ohio. Except that the painting does have a 1/2 inch narrow band of color just inside the outer perimeter all the way around.  But the rest of the painting is just like your submission. It is considered a work of art. So ......... nice shot.</td>', 'There is a painting like this in the Dayton Art Institute in Dayton, Ohio. Except that the painting does have a 1/2 inch narrow band of color just inside the outer perimeter all the way around.  But the rest of the painting is just like your submission. It is considered a work of art. So ......... nice shot.', '2005-06-01 22:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1427622, 184121, 31211, '<td valign="top">Although its not the most original "decision", you''ve managed to take a very professional look like picture. The man''s expression is delightful and gives it a spontaneous feel. Good job.</td>', 'Although its not the most original "decision", you''ve managed to take a very professional look like picture. The man''s expression is delightful and gives it a spontaneous feel. Good job.', '2005-06-01 22:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1427624, 184180, 38078, '<td valign="top">i love an intense game of chess.  great setting.  nice sepia.  BRONC...a little distracting, but i wouldn''t want to interrupt his game and ask him to remove his jacket.</td>', 'i love an intense game of chess.  great setting.  nice sepia.  BRONC...a little distracting, but i wouldn''t want to interrupt his game and ask him to remove his jacket.', '2005-06-01 22:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
