(1427632, 183502, 36141, '<td valign="top">You could''ve made it stronger by puting either the red or yellow wire between the blades, now you''re kind of  hanging ''in between''. Still, I think it''s a good photo. 7.</td>', 'You could''ve made it stronger by puting either the red or yellow wire between the blades, now you''re kind of  hanging ''in between''. Still, I think it''s a good photo. 7.', '2005-06-01 22:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
