(1427660, 183440, 36141, '<td valign="top">Personally I would''ve liked the photo better without the rope. The person could''ve been  making up her mind wether to go out or not, or something like that and that would''ve been decisive enough for me. Ignoring the rope, I like your photo, but the rope bothers me too much to vote above 4</td>', 'Personally I would''ve liked the photo better without the rope. The person could''ve been  making up her mind wether to go out or not, or something like that and that would''ve been decisive enough for me. Ignoring the rope, I like your photo, but the rope bothers me too much to vote above 4', '2005-06-01 22:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
