(1427737, 183328, 37629, '<td valign="top">This could have been a beautiful picture. Had that arm not been there, and the picture been blurry, I suggest checking the picture quality on your camera, I''ve had this blurry problem aswell before, set it to best, it;ll drain the batteries a bit more but it''s well worth the shot. Im an amatuer and have little to no experience, but i hope that helps :)</td>', 'This could have been a beautiful picture. Had that arm not been there, and the picture been blurry, I suggest checking the picture quality on your camera, I''ve had this blurry problem aswell before, set it to best, it;ll drain the batteries a bit more but it''s well worth the shot. Im an amatuer and have little to no experience, but i hope that helps :)', '2005-06-01 23:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
