(1427762, 184064, 28261, '<td valign="top">I like the gradiated lighting from left to right and the sharpness of the change in tones, compared to the cement wall''s seemingly blended shading.  This said, without the title, the image''s story sould say to me a couple guys on a street corner or under a bridge, playing music - and where''s the guy who''s supposed to be playing the drum?  It does not alone tell me a story of making a decision or its effect.  The open case, does hint at it, but is a stretch.  For good technicals and the limited invocation of ''decision'', compared to other entries I offer a 4.</td>', 'I like the gradiated lighting from left to right and the sharpness of the change in tones, compared to the cement wall''s seemingly blended shading.  This said, without the title, the image''s story sould say to me a couple guys on a street corner or under a bridge, playing music - and where''s the guy who''s supposed to be playing the drum?  It does not alone tell me a story of making a decision or its effect.  The open case, does hint at it, but is a stretch.  For good technicals and the limited invocation of ''decision'', compared to other entries I offer a 4.', '2005-06-01 23:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
