(1427842, 183160, 28261, '<td valign="top">A great car collection.  The centered image does not suffer greatly when considering the presence of the other cars, but it does come off flat due to the straight on shot down the grill.  This is well exposed on all levels, but the challenge link comes off very weak.  Without the title it would take me years to guess that decision was the challenge it was submitted to.  Considering the story this image tells, combined with technicals, I can offer a 4.</td>', 'A great car collection.  The centered image does not suffer greatly when considering the presence of the other cars, but it does come off flat due to the straight on shot down the grill.  This is well exposed on all levels, but the challenge link comes off very weak.  Without the title it would take me years to guess that decision was the challenge it was submitted to.  Considering the story this image tells, combined with technicals, I can offer a 4.', '2005-06-01 23:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
