(1428170, 182628, 38476, '<td valign="top">This face is a classic!</td>', 'This face is a classic!', '2005-06-02 01:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1428171, 183501, 37103, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about sports shots, but I love this photo.  The converging angled lines (in the clay and the grass) are a great element.  You caught the perfect moment and of course it fits the theme perfectly.  He''s regretting his decision right at that moment.  In my top 3 for sure.</td>', 'I''m not crazy about sports shots, but I love this photo.  The converging angled lines (in the clay and the grass) are a great element.  You caught the perfect moment and of course it fits the theme perfectly.  He''s regretting his decision right at that moment.  In my top 3 for sure.', '2005-06-02 01:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1428172, 182642, 38401, '<td valign="top">I don''t feel that the image conveys instantly recognizable decision. I''d say because of the shot (he''s already in the process of sinking, you just caught him before he was in to far (splashes around his feet...)), the title hurt it. Nice pic though, I always like capturing motion.</td>', 'I don''t feel that the image conveys instantly recognizable decision. I''d say because of the shot (he''s already in the process of sinking, you just caught him before he was in to far (splashes around his feet...)), the title hurt it. Nice pic though, I always like capturing motion.', '2005-06-02 01:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1428176, 183039, 37103, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful photo.  From our perspective it is very clear what decision she is making.  I love the relaxed pose of the girl and the way you''ve aligned the top of the big picture perfectly with the top of your frame.</td>', 'This is a wonderful photo.  From our perspective it is very clear what decision she is making.  I love the relaxed pose of the girl and the way you''ve aligned the top of the big picture perfectly with the top of your frame.', '2005-06-02 01:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
