(1428493, 184127, 15575, '<td valign="top">I almost thought this was a good decision photo...until I realised there is no decision to be made since both socks are the same!  If there was 1 blue and 1 red sock it would definately meet challege, and I suspect do quite well too.</td>', 'I almost thought this was a good decision photo...until I realised there is no decision to be made since both socks are the same!  If there was 1 blue and 1 red sock it would definately meet challege, and I suspect do quite well too.', '2005-06-02 03:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1428496, 183755, 26526, '<td valign="top">I like this photograph, it has emotional impact. The dog waiting, making a decision? Sure they do. Like the composition, the focus used.  Nice color with shadows. Good shot!</td>', 'I like this photograph, it has emotional impact. The dog waiting, making a decision? Sure they do. Like the composition, the focus used.  Nice color with shadows. Good shot!', '2005-06-02 04:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1428501, 183531, 26526, '<td valign="top">I like this composition. Photographs with people in them are very interesting. Would have liked to see the child attached to those feet. Fits the challenge. Hope you tell us how you got such smooth color like this. Very well done!</td>', 'I like this composition. Photographs with people in them are very interesting. Would have liked to see the child attached to those feet. Fits the challenge. Hope you tell us how you got such smooth color like this. Very well done!', '2005-06-02 04:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1428521, 183068, 26526, '<td valign="top">A little dark, in my opinion. Could be my moniter. I like the way you cropped this photograph with negative space on the top. I assume this depicted wound resulted from a suicide attempt. Will not vote you down because that subject in a forum like this turns me off. I worked in a psychiatric crisis unit. My bias.</td>', 'A little dark, in my opinion. Could be my moniter. I like the way you cropped this photograph with negative space on the top. I assume this depicted wound resulted from a suicide attempt. Will not vote you down because that subject in a forum like this turns me off. I worked in a psychiatric crisis unit. My bias.', '2005-06-02 04:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1428529, 183027, 34547, '<td valign="top">Looks a little heavy on the USM.</td>', 'Looks a little heavy on the USM.', '2005-06-02 04:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1428532, 182750, 34547, '<td valign="top">Ah, that''s great. Look at the catcher''s face!</td>', 'Ah, that''s great. Look at the catcher''s face!', '2005-06-02 04:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1428533, 183539, 26526, '<td valign="top">Like the dof used here.  Very nice colors. Excellent focus. Fits the challenge? Beats me, I am confused on this one. Like the hair cut on the cat. I have a long haired white cat with tangled fur, think I''ll get her shaved like this one.</td>', 'Like the dof used here.  Very nice colors. Excellent focus. Fits the challenge? Beats me, I am confused on this one. Like the hair cut on the cat. I have a long haired white cat with tangled fur, think I''ll get her shaved like this one.', '2005-06-02 04:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1428537, 184007, 34547, '<td valign="top">Interesting textures and lines. I think there might be a better angle.</td>', 'Interesting textures and lines. I think there might be a better angle.', '2005-06-02 04:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1428540, 184018, 34547, '<td valign="top">Could use a little fill lighting.</td>', 'Could use a little fill lighting.', '2005-06-02 04:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
