(1428553, 182187, 34547, '<td valign="top">What an intersting pattern of light. Are those speckles birds?</td>', 'What an intersting pattern of light. Are those speckles birds?', '2005-06-02 04:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1428561, 184173, 37380, '<td valign="top">Nice composition of the golfer, but I find the background (fence / trees) a bit distracting. <br/> <br/>It''s just a suggestion, but I believe that standing up and taking a shot looking down at more of an angle might have given you a shot with mostly grass in the background, removing most of the distractions.</td>', 'Nice composition of the golfer, but I find the background (fence / trees) a bit distracting.  It''s just a suggestion, but I believe that standing up and taking a shot looking down at more of an angle might have given you a shot with mostly grass in the background, removing most of the distractions.', '2005-06-02 05:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1428562, 182741, 37380, '<td valign="top">Everything is nice and in focus, but I foudn that the background was so busy that it was hard to find the fly. Perhaps a closer crop would have helped make the subject a larger  and more significant part of the image.</td>', 'Everything is nice and in focus, but I foudn that the background was so busy that it was hard to find the fly. Perhaps a closer crop would have helped make the subject a larger  and more significant part of the image.', '2005-06-02 05:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1428565, 182112, 37380, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if this is a wonderful abstract or just a blurry shot - but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt.<br/> <br/>The background is nice and clean, emphasizing the colours in your subject.<br/></td>', 'I''m not sure if this is a wonderful abstract or just a blurry shot - but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt. The background is nice and clean, emphasizing the colours in your subject.', '2005-06-02 05:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1428569, 183915, 37380, '<td valign="top">A nice family snap-shot, but I fail to see how it relates to the challenge topic.<br/> <br/>The lighting on the people in the photos is good, but the photo could be improved by having less distractions in the background perhaps - you could acheive this, in part, by cropping most of the background out.</td>', 'A nice family snap-shot, but I fail to see how it relates to the challenge topic. The lighting on the people in the photos is good, but the photo could be improved by having less distractions in the background perhaps - you could acheive this, in part, by cropping most of the background out.', '2005-06-02 05:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
