(1429322, 184149, 35720, '<td valign="top">Great shot. But although I can''t see any dicision I will not rate this shot low because this is a wonderful shot, well composed, sharp with great lighting and good use of DOF. Excellent.</td>', 'Great shot. But although I can''t see any dicision I will not rate this shot low because this is a wonderful shot, well composed, sharp with great lighting and good use of DOF. Excellent.', '2005-06-02 14:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
