(1429342, 183915, 36616, '<td valign="top">Use the full 640 pixels to get more detail. A brighter light would have helped with the contrasts. The challenge is decisions and the answer is not very clear.</td>', 'Use the full 640 pixels to get more detail. A brighter light would have helped with the contrasts. The challenge is decisions and the answer is not very clear.', '2005-06-02 14:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
