(1429388, 183627, 31606, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  Excellent time of day to choose with the perfect natural lighting.  I also like the border choice.  That one bird appears to be looking right at you as if he knew you were taking a photo and waiting on you to finish.  The only thing I can offer as improvement is maybe crop a little more off the bottom to get rid of the brush on the lower left.  9 from me.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-06-20 19:27:05.</i></td>', 'Nice image.  Excellent time of day to choose with the perfect natural lighting.  I also like the border choice.  That one bird appears to be looking right at you as if he knew you were taking a photo and waiting on you to finish.  The only thing I can offer as improvement is maybe crop a little more off the bottom to get rid of the brush on the lower left.  9 from me.', '2005-06-02 15:26:09.000000', '2005-06-20 20:27:05.000000', 1),
