(1429479, 182258, 37103, '<td valign="top">Very appealing image.  I don''t think it represents a decision, although the decision on the artist''s part to choose b&amp;w or color is a nice abstract decision.  For me the ribbon of red around the top of the rowboat really makes this image.</td>', 'Very appealing image.  I don''t think it represents a decision, although the decision on the artist''s part to choose b&w or color is a nice abstract decision.  For me the ribbon of red around the top of the rowboat really makes this image.', '2005-06-02 16:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429483, 183819, 37103, '<td valign="top">I love the stance of her feet.  I thought there would be more "shoe choice" photos in this challenge.  Very humorous.  The photo seems a little bright, but I like the effect.</td>', 'I love the stance of her feet.  I thought there would be more "shoe choice" photos in this challenge.  Very humorous.  The photo seems a little bright, but I like the effect.', '2005-06-02 16:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
