(1429528, 184215, 38072, '<td valign="top">I like this -- You''ve captured the moment of decision -- the rider isn''t contemplating which way to go, nor was the decision made in the past -- it looks like the exact moment.</td>', 'I like this -- You''ve captured the moment of decision -- the rider isn''t contemplating which way to go, nor was the decision made in the past -- it looks like the exact moment.', '2005-06-02 16:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429530, 183902, 38072, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  "Can I get away with this, or not?"  There''s definitely some decision-making going on here, and I think you''ve captured it well.</td>', 'I really like this.  "Can I get away with this, or not?"  There''s definitely some decision-making going on here, and I think you''ve captured it well.', '2005-06-02 16:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
