(1429547, 183798, 24454, '<td valign="top">You could always take the bite yourself, and give the dog the plate to lick.   They like that better anyway  :)   He''s so cute!!!!</td>', 'You could always take the bite yourself, and give the dog the plate to lick.   They like that better anyway  :)   He''s so cute!!!!', '2005-06-02 16:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429550, 184011, 38072, '<td valign="top">This picture doesn''t scream "decision" at me, but with the context of the challenge and the title, I get it, and it''s one that we all make all the time!  Great idea!</td>', 'This picture doesn''t scream "decision" at me, but with the context of the challenge and the title, I get it, and it''s one that we all make all the time!  Great idea!', '2005-06-02 16:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429553, 184049, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awesome!!!</td>', 'Awesome!!!', '2005-06-02 16:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429557, 182580, 38072, '<td valign="top">I had to laugh at this one!  No title is necessary at all to understand what''s going on here.  I can only think of two things that would maybe make this a better shot -- a little more light on the dog &amp; kibble, and somehow coaxing the dog to look more directly at the burger.  But it really does look like there''s a thought process going on there --  I like it.</td>', 'I had to laugh at this one!  No title is necessary at all to understand what''s going on here.  I can only think of two things that would maybe make this a better shot -- a little more light on the dog & kibble, and somehow coaxing the dog to look more directly at the burger.  But it really does look like there''s a thought process going on there --  I like it.', '2005-06-02 16:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429560, 184134, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwwww. . . ..that''s cute.   I see that look in my own dog''s eyes when he''s trying to make friends with a cat. . . slow and steady in hopes not to get his faced bopped by the cat.   I think the decision is probably more in the cat''s mind, "Do I attack and scratch his eyes out, or just hiss at him and hope he goes away."   :)    Very cute photo!!!!!</td>', 'Awwwww. . . ..that''s cute.   I see that look in my own dog''s eyes when he''s trying to make friends with a cat. . . slow and steady in hopes not to get his faced bopped by the cat.   I think the decision is probably more in the cat''s mind, "Do I attack and scratch his eyes out, or just hiss at him and hope he goes away."   :)    Very cute photo!!!!!', '2005-06-02 16:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429566, 183915, 36619, '<td valign="top">i don''t see how this fits in the with challenge subject. it doesn''t seem like much thought was put into this submission.</td>', 'i don''t see how this fits in the with challenge subject. it doesn''t seem like much thought was put into this submission.', '2005-06-02 16:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
