(1429831, 182739, 38401, '<td valign="top">I don''t feel that the image conveys instantly recognizable decision. Great pic, good try.</td>', 'I don''t feel that the image conveys instantly recognizable decision. Great pic, good try.', '2005-06-02 18:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429832, 183531, 38401, '<td valign="top">Good show.</td>', 'Good show.', '2005-06-02 18:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429833, 182489, 24454, '<td valign="top">Powerful portrayal of a decision!    Great job.</td>', 'Powerful portrayal of a decision!    Great job.', '2005-06-02 18:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429834, 183677, 35602, '<td valign="top">The light in the lower right seems to distract from the picture.  The building is very nice, and the red against the black background gives it power.   As a photo it is well composed, but if not for the title, I would not have known what the decision was.</td>', 'The light in the lower right seems to distract from the picture.  The building is very nice, and the red against the black background gives it power.   As a photo it is well composed, but if not for the title, I would not have known what the decision was.', '2005-06-02 18:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429837, 184104, 38401, '<td valign="top">This is a decent image, but it seems pre proposal... thus the 5. I''d like to see a proposal image where the bride to be actually rejects the ring, because I think it would show a decision.. or if there were some emotion on her face of being happy. This was so close.</td>', 'This is a decent image, but it seems pre proposal... thus the 5. I''d like to see a proposal image where the bride to be actually rejects the ring, because I think it would show a decision.. or if there were some emotion on her face of being happy. This was so close.', '2005-06-02 18:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429838, 184105, 38401, '<td valign="top">I don''t feel that the image conveys instantly recognizable decision. Great pic though.</td>', 'I don''t feel that the image conveys instantly recognizable decision. Great pic though.', '2005-06-02 18:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429839, 183428, 38401, '<td valign="top">I don''t feel that the image conveys instantly recognizable decision. Interesting photo to say the least.</td>', 'I don''t feel that the image conveys instantly recognizable decision. Interesting photo to say the least.', '2005-06-02 18:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429840, 184196, 38401, '<td valign="top">I don''t feel that the image conveys instantly recognizable decision. Nice photo.</td>', 'I don''t feel that the image conveys instantly recognizable decision. Nice photo.', '2005-06-02 18:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429841, 183439, 38401, '<td valign="top">I don''t feel that the image conveys instantly recognizable decision. No people, people make chess pieces move, other wise this would have been up there mate. Nice pic!</td>', 'I don''t feel that the image conveys instantly recognizable decision. No people, people make chess pieces move, other wise this would have been up there mate. Nice pic!', '2005-06-02 18:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429842, 183440, 38401, '<td valign="top">I don''t feel that the image conveys instantly recognizable decision. Suicide seems like a way out of decision. Nice entry though.</td>', 'I don''t feel that the image conveys instantly recognizable decision. Suicide seems like a way out of decision. Nice entry though.', '2005-06-02 18:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429843, 183935, 38401, '<td valign="top">I don''t feel that the image conveys instantly recognizable decision. Good shot.</td>', 'I don''t feel that the image conveys instantly recognizable decision. Good shot.', '2005-06-02 18:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429844, 184008, 38401, '<td valign="top">I don''t feel that the image conveys instantly recognizable decision. I love the photo, the title helps too much, I think the decision should be conveyed in the photo. I suppose we have to incorporate a title into some photos simply because we are not all familiar with the subject matter. Good show.</td>', 'I don''t feel that the image conveys instantly recognizable decision. I love the photo, the title helps too much, I think the decision should be conveyed in the photo. I suppose we have to incorporate a title into some photos simply because we are not all familiar with the subject matter. Good show.', '2005-06-02 18:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429845, 184225, 24454, '<td valign="top">That''s cute!!!!   I think this is the best one that showed the decision of healthy eating vs. the sweets because it shows the decision made.   Good job.     I love your title too.</td>', 'That''s cute!!!!   I think this is the best one that showed the decision of healthy eating vs. the sweets because it shows the decision made.   Good job.     I love your title too.', '2005-06-02 18:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429846, 182356, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very clear.  Skintone is excellent, and the orange pencil really stands out.  To me the decision is to draw rather than watch t.v, so I guess it depicts a decision made.</td>', 'Very clear.  Skintone is excellent, and the orange pencil really stands out.  To me the decision is to draw rather than watch t.v, so I guess it depicts a decision made.', '2005-06-02 18:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429847, 182830, 38401, '<td valign="top">I don''t feel that the image conveys instantly recognizable decision. Nice photo, I like it.</td>', 'I don''t feel that the image conveys instantly recognizable decision. Nice photo, I like it.', '2005-06-02 18:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429849, 182120, 38401, '<td valign="top">I don''t feel that the image conveys instantly recognizable decision. Suicide seems liek a way out, otherwise a decent photo.</td>', 'I don''t feel that the image conveys instantly recognizable decision. Suicide seems liek a way out, otherwise a decent photo.', '2005-06-02 18:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429850, 183475, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good bokeh and sharpness, lacks some additional interest. -6</td>', 'Good bokeh and sharpness, lacks some additional interest. -6', '2005-06-02 18:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429851, 183931, 35602, '<td valign="top">Which ever way the wind blows, that is where you''ll find the clouds going.    Putting clouds into the picture shows a decision of nature, which is just as valid as a human one.  Silouette looks great, and the glint of blue in the metal just helps the composition further.</td>', 'Which ever way the wind blows, that is where you''ll find the clouds going.    Putting clouds into the picture shows a decision of nature, which is just as valid as a human one.  Silouette looks great, and the glint of blue in the metal just helps the composition further.', '2005-06-02 18:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429859, 183186, 35602, '<td valign="top">I like the way the water shows motion in this one.</td>', 'I like the way the water shows motion in this one.', '2005-06-02 18:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429861, 183368, 24642, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition and position of the car.</td>', 'Interesting composition and position of the car.', '2005-06-02 18:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429867, 184162, 35602, '<td valign="top">Just learned to play Texas Hold-Um.  Great game.  Definitely a great deal of decision making goes into this game.  I''d definitely hold um and go all in with my chips.</td>', 'Just learned to play Texas Hold-Um.  Great game.  Definitely a great deal of decision making goes into this game.  I''d definitely hold um and go all in with my chips.', '2005-06-02 18:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429870, 183669, 35602, '<td valign="top">Given the overcast light, you did a pretty good job with contrast on this one.</td>', 'Given the overcast light, you did a pretty good job with contrast on this one.', '2005-06-02 18:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429872, 184186, 24642, '<td valign="top">Nice colour tone.  The negative space adds to the drama implied by the title.  -7</td>', 'Nice colour tone.  The negative space adds to the drama implied by the title.  -7', '2005-06-02 18:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429873, 182837, 33732, '<td valign="top">Nice delima.  Colors are nice.  The photo presents the idea.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Nice delima.  Colors are nice.  The photo presents the idea. ', '2005-06-02 18:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429881, 184159, 35602, '<td valign="top">Unlike a ladder, going under a leaning tree is not bad luck.  I''d go under.  I like the bark on these trees.  Nice detail, and the pine in the foreground gives it a lot of softness.</td>', 'Unlike a ladder, going under a leaning tree is not bad luck.  I''d go under.  I like the bark on these trees.  Nice detail, and the pine in the foreground gives it a lot of softness.', '2005-06-02 18:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429882, 184030, 36850, '<td valign="top">Really grainy shot, very good original idea though!</td>', 'Really grainy shot, very good original idea though!', '2005-06-02 18:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429884, 184191, 35602, '<td valign="top">Somewhat dark.  Focus is off too.  All could be taken care of by locking your focus before taking the picture, and maybe compensating the amount of light entering your camera.  I usually take at least 4 different compensation settings for every picture I take.</td>', 'Somewhat dark.  Focus is off too.  All could be taken care of by locking your focus before taking the picture, and maybe compensating the amount of light entering your camera.  I usually take at least 4 different compensation settings for every picture I take.', '2005-06-02 18:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429885, 184096, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and composition. -6</td>', 'Good lighting and composition. -6', '2005-06-02 18:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429886, 182149, 33732, '<td valign="top">The black was done nicely.  The subject is good.  I don''t get the choices.  Could crop more.</td>', 'The black was done nicely.  The subject is good.  I don''t get the choices.  Could crop more.', '2005-06-02 18:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429888, 183818, 31213, '<td valign="top">Where your balls are?  I dont get it.</td>', 'Where your balls are?  I dont get it.', '2005-06-02 18:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429889, 184178, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a nice picture to look at.   So vividly colored and bright.      I would definitely have a hard decision faced with all that.    I''m afraid my decision might be to have a few of each  :)  But seriously, I like your photo a lot.    It''s a little blurry, but I like it a lot anyway.</td>', 'What a nice picture to look at.   So vividly colored and bright.      I would definitely have a hard decision faced with all that.    I''m afraid my decision might be to have a few of each  :)  But seriously, I like your photo a lot.    It''s a little blurry, but I like it a lot anyway.', '2005-06-02 18:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429890, 182640, 33732, '<td valign="top">I like this.  The decision to take the photo with the dark background is nice.  Overexposure was controlled.  Good luck.</td>', 'I like this.  The decision to take the photo with the dark background is nice.  Overexposure was controlled.  Good luck.', '2005-06-02 18:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1429891, 182352, 35602, '<td valign="top">I like the choice of toning on this one.  The choices aren''t really clear, though.  You may have had too slow a shutter speed.  If you don''t have a tripod, even if it is just a tabletop, investing in one makes a big difference with clarity.</td>', 'I like the choice of toning on this one.  The choices aren''t really clear, though.  You may have had too slow a shutter speed.  If you don''t have a tripod, even if it is just a tabletop, investing in one makes a big difference with clarity.', '2005-06-02 18:27:47.000000', NULL, 1);
