(1429898, 183057, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!!!!    I wish I was there!   What a beautiful scene!   I can almost hear the rushing, deafening water!   The squirrel looks a little over exposed, but  I just love your picture anyway!!!!!</td>', 'Wow!!!!    I wish I was there!   What a beautiful scene!   I can almost hear the rushing, deafening water!   The squirrel looks a little over exposed, but  I just love your picture anyway!!!!!', '2005-06-02 18:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
