(1430169, 182312, 35602, '<td valign="top">Color is really too pink.  Indoor shots with no flash always end up with an orange cast, then when you try to color correct, other problems occur.  If you have a white balance function on your camera, sometimes just changing that will help to color correct enough so that when you edit you can get more natural skin tones.</td>', 'Color is really too pink.  Indoor shots with no flash always end up with an orange cast, then when you try to color correct, other problems occur.  If you have a white balance function on your camera, sometimes just changing that will help to color correct enough so that when you edit you can get more natural skin tones.', '2005-06-02 21:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
