(1430178, 184128, 35602, '<td valign="top">Not an easy subject to shoot.  There is a lot of extraneous items asking for attention here.  I don''t know much about printing or dies, but if the item on the top is a radio it doesn''t help to keep ones attention focused on the dies.  Simplifying would have helped.  Remember, what you know of your subject, and what the rest of us know is worlds apart.  Its like writing poetry.  Mine is too detailed, so everybody that reads it says there is too much information, which weakens the poem.</td>', 'Not an easy subject to shoot.  There is a lot of extraneous items asking for attention here.  I don''t know much about printing or dies, but if the item on the top is a radio it doesn''t help to keep ones attention focused on the dies.  Simplifying would have helped.  Remember, what you know of your subject, and what the rest of us know is worlds apart.  Its like writing poetry.  Mine is too detailed, so everybody that reads it says there is too much information, which weakens the poem.', '2005-06-02 21:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
