(1430370, 182560, 28261, '<td valign="top">A stock image that in some ways transcends into art.  Good exposure on a tough subject and the finishing touches of the border also add to the image.<br/> <br/>This said, approaching from a stock perspective, black, leather, shift, knob, gears, metal all come to mind, but without the catchy title this image would not lead me to a keyword use of decision.  I cannot place this in the ranks of those that have told me that story.  I can only offer a 4 for fine technicals, interest and art, but nothing for challenge.</td>', 'A stock image that in some ways transcends into art.  Good exposure on a tough subject and the finishing touches of the border also add to the image. This said, approaching from a stock perspective, black, leather, shift, knob, gears, metal all come to mind, but without the catchy title this image would not lead me to a keyword use of decision.  I cannot place this in the ranks of those that have told me that story.  I can only offer a 4 for fine technicals, interest and art, but nothing for challenge.', '2005-06-02 23:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
