(1430393, 182528, 34547, '<td valign="top">The title makes me scratch my head, but I like the lighting.</td>', 'The title makes me scratch my head, but I like the lighting.', '2005-06-02 23:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430397, 184160, 28261, '<td valign="top">An image that sadly approaches the ugly.  The elements are well placed for success, but the choices to combine them seems much like creating a salad with old cheese, brown lettuce and a tomato or two.  The dirty towel browned blue), scratched scale (white) and foot (with powder blue pjs) coming out of the bottom edge mesh into an image that does not appeal.  All are well photographed, but they do not play well together.<br/> <br/>In reviewing the technicals however, I cannot fault anything there, it is the ingedients of the image that have gone wrong.  Worse is that the image does not invoke decision to me.  Without the context of the challenge, scale, towel, foot, tile all come to mind, but the decision would have been better realized with a person''s head stuck in a refrigerator, sorting through food choices that are good or bad for the weight subject that you have selected to make a statement on.<br/> <br/>Solid technicals, weak concept execution that was harmed by subject choices that repelled the viewer and very weak realtionship to the challenge for this viewer leave me offering a 3.</td>', 'An image that sadly approaches the ugly.  The elements are well placed for success, but the choices to combine them seems much like creating a salad with old cheese, brown lettuce and a tomato or two.  The dirty towel browned blue), scratched scale (white) and foot (with powder blue pjs) coming out of the bottom edge mesh into an image that does not appeal.  All are well photographed, but they do not play well together. In reviewing the technicals however, I cannot fault anything there, it is the ingedients of the image that have gone wrong.  Worse is that the image does not invoke decision to me.  Without the context of the challenge, scale, towel, foot, tile all come to mind, but the decision would have been better realized with a person''s head stuck in a refrigerator, sorting through food choices that are good or bad for the weight subject that you have selected to make a statement on. Solid technicals, weak concept execution that was harmed by subject choices that repelled the viewer and very weak realtionship to the challenge for this viewer leave me offering a 3.', '2005-06-02 23:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430403, 182789, 37684, '<td valign="top">Base:  5<br/>Technical: 0 <br/>Subjective:  2<br/>Challenge:  <br/> <br/>Total:  7<br/>Play always play</td>', 'Base:  5Technical: 0 Subjective:  2Challenge:   Total:  7Play always play', '2005-06-02 23:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430404, 182120, 29009, '<td valign="top">It is obvious a lot of thought went into this entry.  I believe the emotional impact could have been accomplished without nudity.  It seems gratuitous here.  The focal point appears to be the razor, yet it takes up a very small percentage of the frame.  Most of the frame is in very soft focus, which conflicts with what I perceive to be the intended message.  Suicide is not a soft decision, but a hard one and the technical tools should be consistent.  Additionally, the razor appears to have blood on it which leads the viewer to believe the act has already taken place, yet the facial expression is more contemplative. Since the razor is bloody, I''d expect to see the model with closed eyes.  Overall, this is a good effort.</td>', 'It is obvious a lot of thought went into this entry.  I believe the emotional impact could have been accomplished without nudity.  It seems gratuitous here.  The focal point appears to be the razor, yet it takes up a very small percentage of the frame.  Most of the frame is in very soft focus, which conflicts with what I perceive to be the intended message.  Suicide is not a soft decision, but a hard one and the technical tools should be consistent.  Additionally, the razor appears to have blood on it which leads the viewer to believe the act has already taken place, yet the facial expression is more contemplative. Since the razor is bloody, I''d expect to see the model with closed eyes.  Overall, this is a good effort.', '2005-06-02 23:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430406, 183933, 29009, '<td valign="top">Lighting is excellent here.</td>', 'Lighting is excellent here.', '2005-06-02 23:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430407, 183810, 37684, '<td valign="top">Base:  5<br/>Technical: 0 <br/>Subjective:  2<br/>Challenge:  <br/> <br/>Total:  7<br/>I love roly polys.</td>', 'Base:  5Technical: 0 Subjective:  2Challenge:   Total:  7I love roly polys.', '2005-06-02 23:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430410, 182887, 29009, '<td valign="top">This was a good idea.  The lighting on the pliers could be improved - it took me awhile to find it amidst all the other elements.  Overall, a decent shot that clearly meets the challenge.</td>', 'This was a good idea.  The lighting on the pliers could be improved - it took me awhile to find it amidst all the other elements.  Overall, a decent shot that clearly meets the challenge.', '2005-06-02 23:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430411, 182598, 28261, '<td valign="top">An image that makes me wish that you had not used the gothic glow effect.  It is in itself very appealing but the processing here has left the grass too dark, the water too greyblue.  I am not reminded of the golf which your title is invoking as the greens I see on TV are much lighter colored.  The water is not inviting to me because it is not that blue I see the ocean as.<br/> <br/>Without the title, this image would not invoke to me a decision, it would say lush, relaxation, peace, perhaps even vacation, but there is no story told here like some other images and I cannot rank it among those that have done this visually without the aide of a title.  I can only offer a 4 based on an appealing image that could have drawn me into a beautiful repose had the processing left more to the natural.</td>', 'An image that makes me wish that you had not used the gothic glow effect.  It is in itself very appealing but the processing here has left the grass too dark, the water too greyblue.  I am not reminded of the golf which your title is invoking as the greens I see on TV are much lighter colored.  The water is not inviting to me because it is not that blue I see the ocean as. Without the title, this image would not invoke to me a decision, it would say lush, relaxation, peace, perhaps even vacation, but there is no story told here like some other images and I cannot rank it among those that have done this visually without the aide of a title.  I can only offer a 4 based on an appealing image that could have drawn me into a beautiful repose had the processing left more to the natural.', '2005-06-02 23:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430413, 182741, 37684, '<td valign="top">Base:  5<br/>Technical:  0<br/>Subjective:  2<br/>Challenge:  <br/> <br/>Total:  7<br/>Took a while to find the fly :)</td>', 'Base:  5Technical:  0Subjective:  2Challenge:   Total:  7Took a while to find the fly :)', '2005-06-02 23:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430414, 183673, 29009, '<td valign="top">Composition could be improved by keeping the rule of thirds in mind.  Your focal point should take up a larger part of the frame.  DOF is backwards - the focal point should be in sharper focus than the rest of the frame.</td>', 'Composition could be improved by keeping the rule of thirds in mind.  Your focal point should take up a larger part of the frame.  DOF is backwards - the focal point should be in sharper focus than the rest of the frame.', '2005-06-02 23:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430415, 183053, 28261, '<td valign="top">Your title poses a question giving context to the image but alone the image is a well photographed artistic rendition of two wine glasses, one that may simply be in shadows or a different color, it is not apparent.  I am not inclined to add the word decision to this image''s keywords.  glass, wine, art, gold, yes.  This said the composition and finesse redeem much of the scoring, but I am left only offering a 4.</td>', 'Your title poses a question giving context to the image but alone the image is a well photographed artistic rendition of two wine glasses, one that may simply be in shadows or a different color, it is not apparent.  I am not inclined to add the word decision to this image''s keywords.  glass, wine, art, gold, yes.  This said the composition and finesse redeem much of the scoring, but I am left only offering a 4.', '2005-06-02 23:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430416, 182919, 29009, '<td valign="top">Colors are excellent and good use of lines here.  I don''t see a decision as much as I see a choice; however, I still gave a good score.</td>', 'Colors are excellent and good use of lines here.  I don''t see a decision as much as I see a choice; however, I still gave a good score.', '2005-06-02 23:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
