(1430440, 182957, 29009, '<td valign="top">This is just fantastic.  I don''t care for your subject matter, but this was technically well-done so I just have to score it well.</td>', 'This is just fantastic.  I don''t care for your subject matter, but this was technically well-done so I just have to score it well.', '2005-06-02 23:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430442, 184011, 29009, '<td valign="top">Composition could be improved using the rule of thirds.  Colors are not as well represented as they could be, and without knowledge of the title or challenge I would not associate the image with a decisions.  Overall, this shot lacks the visual appeal found in other challenge entries.</td>', 'Composition could be improved using the rule of thirds.  Colors are not as well represented as they could be, and without knowledge of the title or challenge I would not associate the image with a decisions.  Overall, this shot lacks the visual appeal found in other challenge entries.', '2005-06-02 23:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430452, 183993, 24970, '<td valign="top">This could be improved by the grass being in focus and taking up more of the frame.</td>', 'This could be improved by the grass being in focus and taking up more of the frame.', '2005-06-03 00:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430457, 184018, 24970, '<td valign="top">Well done, technically.  Looks a little odd to just have the corkscrew sitting there with no obvious human intervention; it''s a very sterile feeling.</td>', 'Well done, technically.  Looks a little odd to just have the corkscrew sitting there with no obvious human intervention; it''s a very sterile feeling.', '2005-06-03 00:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430461, 184149, 28261, '<td valign="top">Technically and artistically a strong image that could become a wall hanging.  That said, a dandelion has no thought process and I find it hard to personify a flower in the manner you are trying to promote the image on.  Without the title, this would be keyworded with flower, white, dandelion, seed, floating, but not decision.  Strong interest, artistic approach, great detail in a macro with a moving secondary object, but I cannot place this in the ranks of the images that invoked the story of the decision.  I can only offer a 4.</td>', 'Technically and artistically a strong image that could become a wall hanging.  That said, a dandelion has no thought process and I find it hard to personify a flower in the manner you are trying to promote the image on.  Without the title, this would be keyworded with flower, white, dandelion, seed, floating, but not decision.  Strong interest, artistic approach, great detail in a macro with a moving secondary object, but I cannot place this in the ranks of the images that invoked the story of the decision.  I can only offer a 4.', '2005-06-03 00:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430464, 183100, 24970, '<td valign="top">Colors are pretty washed out, better lighting or increased saturation would help.  Also, it''s shot a little close to your subjects; I''d like to see the bottom of the electric and possibly more of the hand/arm.</td>', 'Colors are pretty washed out, better lighting or increased saturation would help.  Also, it''s shot a little close to your subjects; I''d like to see the bottom of the electric and possibly more of the hand/arm.', '2005-06-03 00:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430466, 183027, 28261, '<td valign="top">This image suffers from what appears to be maximum oversharpening.  There are fatal flaws in the halos around the geese, creating an effect that they were painted onto the background.  This is unfortunate as the composition is well laid out and the image has an interest factor.  I would not place a keyword of decision on this image, as it does not tell me a story of decision due to the stance of the main subject.  It does not look spooked or prepared to move.  I can only offer a 3, primarliy based on flaws that can be redeemed in the composition and post processing.. the image has potential, it was simply presented in a less flattering way than it could have been.</td>', 'This image suffers from what appears to be maximum oversharpening.  There are fatal flaws in the halos around the geese, creating an effect that they were painted onto the background.  This is unfortunate as the composition is well laid out and the image has an interest factor.  I would not place a keyword of decision on this image, as it does not tell me a story of decision due to the stance of the main subject.  It does not look spooked or prepared to move.  I can only offer a 3, primarliy based on flaws that can be redeemed in the composition and post processing.. the image has potential, it was simply presented in a less flattering way than it could have been.', '2005-06-03 00:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430481, 183493, 24970, '<td valign="top">Post-processing has done some interesting things to the colors, especially on the apple. Was there originally not enough light? Decent composition, esp. with the grainy stuff (sugar?) leading in.</td>', 'Post-processing has done some interesting things to the colors, especially on the apple. Was there originally not enough light? Decent composition, esp. with the grainy stuff (sugar?) leading in.', '2005-06-03 00:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430483, 184225, 24970, '<td valign="top">Good composition, it leads the eye smoothly back through the picture. What is the brown stuff on the plate with the apple?</td>', 'Good composition, it leads the eye smoothly back through the picture. What is the brown stuff on the plate with the apple?', '2005-06-03 00:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430485, 182580, 28359, '<td valign="top">Love it !! Technically prefect, colors/tones, sharp and I can relate to the story, .....nice capture.</td>', 'Love it !! Technically prefect, colors/tones, sharp and I can relate to the story, .....nice capture.', '2005-06-03 00:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430490, 183628, 24970, '<td valign="top">NIce composition, the boy in the corner looking into the picture makes us look that way too. Not sure who he''s playing with, as the title implies he is - I don''t see anyone else. The dimensions are little small for people here...doesn''t bug me but you''ll probably get some complaints.</td>', 'NIce composition, the boy in the corner looking into the picture makes us look that way too. Not sure who he''s playing with, as the title implies he is - I don''t see anyone else. The dimensions are little small for people here...doesn''t bug me but you''ll probably get some complaints.', '2005-06-03 00:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430499, 184026, 24970, '<td valign="top">People will probably complain this is too dark. There isn''t much lighting on the signs, but we can read what they say and really that''s all that matters. Catching this in early morning or later evening, when the sun angles in on them, would help with that problem.</td>', 'People will probably complain this is too dark. There isn''t much lighting on the signs, but we can read what they say and really that''s all that matters. Catching this in early morning or later evening, when the sun angles in on them, would help with that problem.', '2005-06-03 00:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430506, 182837, 24970, '<td valign="top">Interesting juxtaposition of elements. The overall picture has a feeling of peace and nature, and yet there''s a large intersection...blatant human involvement. Well-done technically and beautifully composed.</td>', 'Interesting juxtaposition of elements. The overall picture has a feeling of peace and nature, and yet there''s a large intersection...blatant human involvement. Well-done technically and beautifully composed.', '2005-06-03 00:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430510, 183701, 24970, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done shot, it''s clear and has great composition. I love how the plane is barely contained in the picture. Forced into the challenge with the title, though.</td>', 'Very nicely done shot, it''s clear and has great composition. I love how the plane is barely contained in the picture. Forced into the challenge with the title, though.', '2005-06-03 00:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430520, 182549, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty much how I look when I play chess. I''m sure this young lady could beat me in just four moves! Good capture of perplexed.</td>', 'Pretty much how I look when I play chess. I''m sure this young lady could beat me in just four moves! Good capture of perplexed.', '2005-06-03 00:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430523, 184193, 24970, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done shot that requires the title to meet the challenge. The lighting is great and focus is really sharp...reflections in the glas are a little distracting but incredibly difficult to avoid, so I won''t come down too hard about that. I suppose you could rig something up so there''s a black screen in front too and shoot through a hole in it (that''s just a thought here though, I''ve never tried anything like it).</td>', 'Beautifully done shot that requires the title to meet the challenge. The lighting is great and focus is really sharp...reflections in the glas are a little distracting but incredibly difficult to avoid, so I won''t come down too hard about that. I suppose you could rig something up so there''s a black screen in front too and shoot through a hole in it (that''s just a thought here though, I''ve never tried anything like it).', '2005-06-03 00:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430530, 183144, 33672, '<td valign="top">A lttle dark, Needed to be a better day to use the fast shutter speed this shot required.</td>', 'A lttle dark, Needed to be a better day to use the fast shutter speed this shot required.', '2005-06-03 00:38:44.000000', NULL, 1);
