(1430551, 183980, 38401, '<td valign="top">I don''t ''feel'' as thought the bird is making any decision. The photo, which although a very good one, doesn''t depict the action of making a decision or request the veiwer to make a decision. The title helps to understand your perspective as the photographer (ie.. what is that bird thinking?) but I don''t feel it in the photo. Actually decision making is difficult to depict in animals, their expressions are not as easily recongnizable as a humans. Just my opinion. Otherwise a very nice photo.</td>', 'I don''t ''feel'' as thought the bird is making any decision. The photo, which although a very good one, doesn''t depict the action of making a decision or request the veiwer to make a decision. The title helps to understand your perspective as the photographer (ie.. what is that bird thinking?) but I don''t feel it in the photo. Actually decision making is difficult to depict in animals, their expressions are not as easily recongnizable as a humans. Just my opinion. Otherwise a very nice photo.', '2005-06-03 00:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
