(1430769, 184100, 37380, '<td valign="top">You clearly show your choices, but I find the lighting somewhat distracting. Just my opinion, but I think it would have turned out better if the hand wasn''t so bright.</td>', 'You clearly show your choices, but I find the lighting somewhat distracting. Just my opinion, but I think it would have turned out better if the hand wasn''t so bright.', '2005-06-03 03:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
