(1430776, 182269, 37380, '<td valign="top">A good b/w shot. The grain in the fence in the background is good, but I''m finding that the pickets in the front a bit too ''glaring'' for my liking. I love how sharp the image is though.</td>', 'A good b/w shot. The grain in the fence in the background is good, but I''m finding that the pickets in the front a bit too ''glaring'' for my liking. I love how sharp the image is though.', '2005-06-03 03:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430782, 181996, 37380, '<td valign="top">A nice shot. I think I would have left the image without any border decorations, but otherwise a good composition and the subject well in focus.<br/> <br/>Just as final suggestion - try cropping out the top third and left third of the image. I think that you''ll end up with an even more dramatic image :)<br/> <br/>Good luck!</td>', 'A nice shot. I think I would have left the image without any border decorations, but otherwise a good composition and the subject well in focus. Just as final suggestion - try cropping out the top third and left third of the image. I think that you''ll end up with an even more dramatic image :) Good luck!', '2005-06-03 03:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430787, 182410, 37380, '<td valign="top">Try cropping out the left and right portions of the image. The subject will be more prominent and you''ll get rid of most of the bright sky which is a bit of a distraction. Other than that, I think it is a nice photo, in focus with some great colours. Well done!</td>', 'Try cropping out the left and right portions of the image. The subject will be more prominent and you''ll get rid of most of the bright sky which is a bit of a distraction. Other than that, I think it is a nice photo, in focus with some great colours. Well done!', '2005-06-03 03:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430794, 182149, 37380, '<td valign="top">Maybe my screen isn''t bright enough, but it''s hard to make out what''s in the photo.</td>', 'Maybe my screen isn''t bright enough, but it''s hard to make out what''s in the photo.', '2005-06-03 03:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430799, 184079, 37380, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot! Suggestion: try recomposing the photo next time to get rid of the grill in the background - it''s a bit distracting. Keeping the background as featureless as possible will allow the viewer to focus on your subject.</td>', 'An interesting shot! Suggestion: try recomposing the photo next time to get rid of the grill in the background - it''s a bit distracting. Keeping the background as featureless as possible will allow the viewer to focus on your subject.', '2005-06-03 04:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430803, 183479, 37380, '<td valign="top">A nice simple shot, bordering on the abstract. Good use of bold primary colours make for a very energetic composition.<br/> <br/>Well done!</td>', 'A nice simple shot, bordering on the abstract. Good use of bold primary colours make for a very energetic composition. Well done!', '2005-06-03 04:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430810, 184184, 37380, '<td valign="top">LOL! Yes, a definite decision in this shot! Good use of b/w removed distractions from the background and draws attention to the subject by way of the texture in her shirt. There is a lot of unused space between the subject and the car''s roof. I''m not sure if the roof is an integral part of the shot, but cropping just above the subject''s head might have aided the composition.</td>', 'LOL! Yes, a definite decision in this shot! Good use of b/w removed distractions from the background and draws attention to the subject by way of the texture in her shirt. There is a lot of unused space between the subject and the car''s roof. I''m not sure if the roof is an integral part of the shot, but cropping just above the subject''s head might have aided the composition.', '2005-06-03 04:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430815, 184180, 37380, '<td valign="top">The white chair on the right is a bit distracting and I wouldn''t have missed it if it was cropped out. Otherwise a great photo - lovely use of sepia &amp; grain. It gives it a very ''real'' feel.</td>', 'The white chair on the right is a bit distracting and I wouldn''t have missed it if it was cropped out. Otherwise a great photo - lovely use of sepia & grain. It gives it a very ''real'' feel.', '2005-06-03 04:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1430817, 184226, 37380, '<td valign="top">One of the best suicide/gun photos in the challenge. Great use of light, and I''m not sure what is it but the image has a certain ''movie'' feel to it. Well done.</td>', 'One of the best suicide/gun photos in the challenge. Great use of light, and I''m not sure what is it but the image has a certain ''movie'' feel to it. Well done.', '2005-06-03 04:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
