(1431553, 183563, 34459, '<td valign="top">oh another wire-cutting pic ! But I must say this is the best one so far, so well done. The background is a little distracting but at least you''ve kept the wires simple.</td>', 'oh another wire-cutting pic ! But I must say this is the best one so far, so well done. The background is a little distracting but at least you''ve kept the wires simple.', '2005-06-03 15:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
