(1431569, 183819, 25678, '<td valign="top">I love how you implied a decision in this picture.  Personally, it would have been nice with a greater variety of shoes (color maybe?).  Anyways, love the picture!</td>', 'I love how you implied a decision in this picture.  Personally, it would have been nice with a greater variety of shoes (color maybe?).  Anyways, love the picture!', '2005-06-03 15:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
