(1432643, 183135, 35548, '<td valign="top">I like this photo very much.  I have been holding off on judging it because I just don''t know how it fits with the challeng so here I go trying to make sense  of it all.<br/> <br/>Artistic...............7  I like all the activity in the frame and how the whole frame is being used. Lots of strong lines moving my eyes and keeping me interested<br/> <br/>Technical......7   The overall exposure of the image is very balanced, no real big problems in seeing detail in the lightest or darkest areas.  Photo doesn''t seem to have come from a digital camera, believe me this is a plus as I don''t like images that are over processed or photos that have focus that is "hyper".<br/> <br/>Meets challenge description....this is the one I have been trying to deal with for the past few days with this image.....My first response to this image was that I didn''t see anybody in this photo making any decision, it appears that this is one of those mindless acts of "group think", that all these worriers are just pushing foreward because the other guy in front of him was told to go foreward so if he goes I will follow.....I suppose that is a decision.....so you get a ....6 for meeting the challenge.<br/> <br/>Average 6  but I''ll push you up to 7 because I haven''t seen anything in this challenge that has this subject or quality combined......</td>', 'I like this photo very much.  I have been holding off on judging it because I just don''t know how it fits with the challeng so here I go trying to make sense  of it all. Artistic...............7  I like all the activity in the frame and how the whole frame is being used. Lots of strong lines moving my eyes and keeping me interested Technical......7   The overall exposure of the image is very balanced, no real big problems in seeing detail in the lightest or darkest areas.  Photo doesn''t seem to have come from a digital camera, believe me this is a plus as I don''t like images that are over processed or photos that have focus that is "hyper". Meets challenge description....this is the one I have been trying to deal with for the past few days with this image.....My first response to this image was that I didn''t see anybody in this photo making any decision, it appears that this is one of those mindless acts of "group think", that all these worriers are just pushing foreward because the other guy in front of him was told to go foreward so if he goes I will follow.....I suppose that is a decision.....so you get a ....6 for meeting the challenge. Average 6  but I''ll push you up to 7 because I haven''t seen anything in this challenge that has this subject or quality combined......', '2005-06-04 08:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
