(1432854, 183144, 35548, '<td valign="top">I think this could be argued that these polites are so well practiced that at this point there are no decisions being made at this point....But that being said I believe that the brain is wired to make decisions all of the time.....5 for meeting the challenge description.<br/> <br/>Artistic.....5<br/> <br/>Technical.....3   The whites on the jets are to gray and the image is not clear.<br/> <br/>Average is 4<br/> <br/></td>', 'I think this could be argued that these polites are so well practiced that at this point there are no decisions being made at this point....But that being said I believe that the brain is wired to make decisions all of the time.....5 for meeting the challenge description. Artistic.....5 Technical.....3   The whites on the jets are to gray and the image is not clear. Average is 4 ', '2005-06-04 11:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
