(1433006, 184018, 22046, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective. Hmmm. Is the cork screw really that long so it goes all the way through the cork and comes out the other side? I haven''t ever seen any that long.</td>', 'Simple and effective. Hmmm. Is the cork screw really that long so it goes all the way through the cork and comes out the other side? I haven''t ever seen any that long.', '2005-06-04 13:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1433031, 184069, 32033, '<td valign="top">to much sharpening</td>', 'to much sharpening', '2005-06-04 14:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1433035, 184149, 34192, '<td valign="top">There''s a wistfulness about this image that I love.  Technically pretty good.  The focus is not exact - maybe one stop smaller would fix that.  Decision?  no clue.  Honestly don''t believe a plant can make a decision.  However, if I ignore the title (or my take on it) the decision was to blow the seeds away.  Which works for me!  Love the lighting - greatly enhances the image.  8 for now, may bump later...  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'There''s a wistfulness about this image that I love.  Technically pretty good.  The focus is not exact - maybe one stop smaller would fix that.  Decision?  no clue.  Honestly don''t believe a plant can make a decision.  However, if I ignore the title (or my take on it) the decision was to blow the seeds away.  Which works for me!  Love the lighting - greatly enhances the image.  8 for now, may bump later...  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-04 14:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1433037, 182327, 34192, '<td valign="top">He doesn''t have either?  Ignoring the title, I would say he decided to shave.  I love the angle, crop and point of view but the pink cast bothers me and detracts from an interesting capture otherwise. Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'He doesn''t have either?  Ignoring the title, I would say he decided to shave.  I love the angle, crop and point of view but the pink cast bothers me and detracts from an interesting capture otherwise. Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-06-04 14:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
