(1433134, 183904, 24970, '<td valign="top">Ah, that''s tough. Subjects are well-placed in the frame, and lighting is fitting for the setting. Though it''s a little odd to have the right side of the picture so well-lit when there''s nothing of importance over there to look at. Might have considered moving the small tables, or putting something more living room - like on them, like a lamp. Looks a little cluttered and tacky as is. Clarity is a little hazy around the people especially, I don''t know enough about things to say why, might be a product of resizing.</td>', 'Ah, that''s tough. Subjects are well-placed in the frame, and lighting is fitting for the setting. Though it''s a little odd to have the right side of the picture so well-lit when there''s nothing of importance over there to look at. Might have considered moving the small tables, or putting something more living room - like on them, like a lamp. Looks a little cluttered and tacky as is. Clarity is a little hazy around the people especially, I don''t know enough about things to say why, might be a product of resizing.', '2005-06-04 15:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
