(1434206, 182739, 6349, '<td valign="top">The best photo of the challenge.  better take the blue.  shame it wasn''t advanced editing.  I''d definetely get rid of the bright seat belt buckle and not sure how i feel about the photographers reflection, it might be good...either way, this photo is still fantastic.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-06-08 00:18:34.</i></td>', 'The best photo of the challenge.  better take the blue.  shame it wasn''t advanced editing.  I''d definetely get rid of the bright seat belt buckle and not sure how i feel about the photographers reflection, it might be good...either way, this photo is still fantastic.', '2005-06-05 11:04:54.000000', '2005-06-08 01:18:34.000000', 1),
(1434216, 184012, 30896, '<td valign="top">:-)<br/>this one took me much more than usual three seconds (mostly because i expected the picture had not yet downloaded ;-) but as i try to vote on basis of photographic quality - well, sorry, this cannot score high</td>', ':-)this one took me much more than usual three seconds (mostly because i expected the picture had not yet downloaded ;-) but as i try to vote on basis of photographic quality - well, sorry, this cannot score high', '2005-06-05 11:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
