(1434261, 182837, 34283, '<td valign="top">What a great photo!</td>', 'What a great photo!', '2005-06-05 12:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1434262, 182807, 34283, '<td valign="top">Slightly off centre, but nice.</td>', 'Slightly off centre, but nice.', '2005-06-05 12:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1434268, 184222, 24970, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, and the pretty coloring gives this a deceptively calm, relaxed feel.  I can''t tell, what are the circular objects in the background - reflections? Parts of the table?</td>', 'Nicely composed, and the pretty coloring gives this a deceptively calm, relaxed feel.  I can''t tell, what are the circular objects in the background - reflections? Parts of the table?', '2005-06-05 12:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1434270, 183009, 24970, '<td valign="top">A different take on the path-splitting idea, this is the result of that choice? A little small, whch people here don''t seem to like.  Maybe shooting this from more of an angle would make it a little more interesting to look at rather than the straight line down the middle.</td>', 'A different take on the path-splitting idea, this is the result of that choice? A little small, whch people here don''t seem to like.  Maybe shooting this from more of an angle would make it a little more interesting to look at rather than the straight line down the middle.', '2005-06-05 12:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1434271, 184203, 24970, '<td valign="top">Shot from this angle, we don''t really get any depth to this, it''s not very obvious that the coin is in the air above the hand.  It''s nice and clear but a very flat picture.</td>', 'Shot from this angle, we don''t really get any depth to this, it''s not very obvious that the coin is in the air above the hand.  It''s nice and clear but a very flat picture.', '2005-06-05 12:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1434272, 183714, 24642, '<td valign="top">Looks like a very tough moment.<br/>A good title matching the subject.  I think that placing the boy in the top right corner and including the girls legs would improove the photo.<br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Looks like a very tough moment.A good title matching the subject.  I think that placing the boy in the top right corner and including the girls legs would improove the photo.Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-06-05 12:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1434275, 183933, 24642, '<td valign="top">A good photograph but I can''t relate it to the challenge.</td>', 'A good photograph but I can''t relate it to the challenge.', '2005-06-05 12:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1434277, 184222, 24642, '<td valign="top">Rough stuff</td>', 'Rough stuff', '2005-06-05 12:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1434279, 182354, 24970, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot technically, I''m sorry but I can''t vote it as highly as I''d like - the challenge factors into my voting and I don''t see how this meets it without the title. That said, the colors and lighting are gorgeous, and the focus is dead on. Nice capture!</td>', 'Beautiful shot technically, I''m sorry but I can''t vote it as highly as I''d like - the challenge factors into my voting and I don''t see how this meets it without the title. That said, the colors and lighting are gorgeous, and the focus is dead on. Nice capture!', '2005-06-05 12:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1434283, 182112, 24970, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the attempt at something abstract, it''s really quite a pretty picture.  Wish the title gave me a clearer idea what to think of it, and how it''s a decision.</td>', 'I appreciate the attempt at something abstract, it''s really quite a pretty picture.  Wish the title gave me a clearer idea what to think of it, and how it''s a decision.', '2005-06-05 12:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1434285, 183669, 24970, '<td valign="top">Because of the jumble behind them, the two girls in the center don''t really catch my eye, though they seem to be the subjects.  Nice clear picture though, and the border adds a good finishing touch without being intrusive at all.</td>', 'Because of the jumble behind them, the two girls in the center don''t really catch my eye, though they seem to be the subjects.  Nice clear picture though, and the border adds a good finishing touch without being intrusive at all.', '2005-06-05 12:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1434288, 182647, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, the colours and the graphical quality.</td>', 'I like the composition, the colours and the graphical quality.', '2005-06-05 12:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1434289, 183935, 34247, '<td valign="top">Love the light, and the shadow of the hand on the ground. If it weren''t basic edit, I''d crop out the two diagonal shadows on the right hand wall, or at least the longer bottom one. Love the smile and look on the older kid. 9, bump to 10.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-06-08 00:03:51.</i></td>', 'Love the light, and the shadow of the hand on the ground. If it weren''t basic edit, I''d crop out the two diagonal shadows on the right hand wall, or at least the longer bottom one. Love the smile and look on the older kid. 9, bump to 10.', '2005-06-05 12:27:42.000000', '2005-06-08 01:03:51.000000', 1),
(1434290, 184098, 24970, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of focal point, had you panned with the girl she''d be the subject but as is it''s the grafitti behind her.  This might not be the angle you''re going for, but a schoolish prop (if this wasn''t a candid) could tell more of a story...her deciding to study instead of be on the streets.</td>', 'Interesting choice of focal point, had you panned with the girl she''d be the subject but as is it''s the grafitti behind her.  This might not be the angle you''re going for, but a schoolish prop (if this wasn''t a candid) could tell more of a story...her deciding to study instead of be on the streets.', '2005-06-05 12:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1434292, 184025, 24642, '<td valign="top">A very clever idea.  More DOF would improove the shot.</td>', 'A very clever idea.  More DOF would improove the shot.', '2005-06-05 12:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1434293, 184151, 24970, '<td valign="top">I really like the light coming in from the window on the left, and the setup of this shot makes it very interesting to look at.  Good use of b&amp;w, this could have felt very cluttered in color.</td>', 'I really like the light coming in from the window on the left, and the setup of this shot makes it very interesting to look at.  Good use of b&w, this could have felt very cluttered in color.', '2005-06-05 12:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1434294, 184004, 24642, '<td valign="top">Very sharp, good viewpoint and great lighting.</td>', 'Very sharp, good viewpoint and great lighting.', '2005-06-05 12:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1434295, 183692, 24314, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind this photo, seems to be one of the few that fit the challenge!</td>', 'I like the idea behind this photo, seems to be one of the few that fit the challenge!', '2005-06-05 12:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1434297, 184105, 24970, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, it''s very clear and has a good feeling of height to it. The expression is great too.  Loose tie to the challenge though, it relies very heavily on the title.</td>', 'Nice capture, it''s very clear and has a good feeling of height to it. The expression is great too.  Loose tie to the challenge though, it relies very heavily on the title.', '2005-06-05 12:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
