(1437834, 182672, 35602, '<td valign="top">Much of the image lacked detail.  I like the colors of the flowers, but if the image were clearer I would have probably rated this one higher.  Maybe a tripod would have kept the image tighter.</td>', 'Much of the image lacked detail.  I like the colors of the flowers, but if the image were clearer I would have probably rated this one higher.  Maybe a tripod would have kept the image tighter.', '2005-06-06 22:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
