(1437866, 182957, 35602, '<td valign="top">As a shot depicting sucide choices, I liked the black and white choice, but the image didn''t have the snap I look for.  B&amp;w takes a lot of practice because we see with color, not gray tones.  Hope to see more trys with b&amp;w from you.</td>', 'As a shot depicting sucide choices, I liked the black and white choice, but the image didn''t have the snap I look for.  B&w takes a lot of practice because we see with color, not gray tones.  Hope to see more trys with b&w from you.', '2005-06-06 22:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
