(1438089, 182489, 28261, '<td valign="top">This image originally held a low spot on the meter for me.  What about the foot and tag would lead me to the decision required to place this higher?  As I studied, I saw the text that eluded me before:  Unbelted Driver.  Motor Vehicle Crash.  This was the outcome of the decision.  A warning to others.  The blue of the foot seems unnatural, not like cold skin, but the placement in the dark with the tag is effective.  The tag would have more effect had it been Typewritten wording or at least in larger letters I would have noticed sooner instead of on the third pass at these images.  I give a solid link to the decision because of the tag''s presence and its text, good marks for composition and detail, but find that compared to other images in the challenge am held back from offering higher score when comparing it to the caliber of statement that those have made.  Still it is bumping to a 6.</td>', 'This image originally held a low spot on the meter for me.  What about the foot and tag would lead me to the decision required to place this higher?  As I studied, I saw the text that eluded me before:  Unbelted Driver.  Motor Vehicle Crash.  This was the outcome of the decision.  A warning to others.  The blue of the foot seems unnatural, not like cold skin, but the placement in the dark with the tag is effective.  The tag would have more effect had it been Typewritten wording or at least in larger letters I would have noticed sooner instead of on the third pass at these images.  I give a solid link to the decision because of the tag''s presence and its text, good marks for composition and detail, but find that compared to other images in the challenge am held back from offering higher score when comparing it to the caliber of statement that those have made.  Still it is bumping to a 6.', '2005-06-07 00:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1438091, 182841, 23456, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture , DOF and focus AND meets the challenge. Good luck !  So who played, Roosters and ????</td>', 'Excellent capture , DOF and focus AND meets the challenge. Good luck !  So who played, Roosters and ????', '2005-06-07 00:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
