(1438093, 183627, 28261, '<td valign="top">The coloration of this image is beautiful.  I like the choice of crop to position the birds and the levels of detail that remains in the dimming light. Even the border adds to the finesse. It is an image that should grace a wall.<br/> <br/>That said, without the title, I would see no link to the concept or keyword of decision.  Is the gull stretching the wings for flight or for balance or is it landing?  I cannot rate this in the same category as the images that have told me a story of decision simply from the photo, however must give very high marks for interest level and technicals.  A (4)</td>', 'The coloration of this image is beautiful.  I like the choice of crop to position the birds and the levels of detail that remains in the dimming light. Even the border adds to the finesse. It is an image that should grace a wall. That said, without the title, I would see no link to the concept or keyword of decision.  Is the gull stretching the wings for flight or for balance or is it landing?  I cannot rate this in the same category as the images that have told me a story of decision simply from the photo, however must give very high marks for interest level and technicals.  A (4)', '2005-06-07 00:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
