(1439125, 184131, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very good capture of the metal detail.  Are you a ren faire patron?   The light on the sword is also quite good.  A little weak on conveying a decision, though.  Still the picture came out really fine.</td>', 'Very good capture of the metal detail.  Are you a ren faire patron?   The light on the sword is also quite good.  A little weak on conveying a decision, though.  Still the picture came out really fine.', '2005-06-07 16:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
