(1439135, 184186, 35602, '<td valign="top">I guess you have decided on turning to the Bible instead of losing yourself in the bottle.  I thought the concept was really good.  I also like the redish tinted lighting.  It really brought the entire picture together.  Thanks for sharing this idea.  I might use it in one of my creations.</td>', 'I guess you have decided on turning to the Bible instead of losing yourself in the bottle.  I thought the concept was really good.  I also like the redish tinted lighting.  It really brought the entire picture together.  Thanks for sharing this idea.  I might use it in one of my creations.', '2005-06-07 16:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1439140, 184020, 35602, '<td valign="top">Loved the picture. Very good animal shot.  However, the decision is lost on me.  Don''t see a connection to the challenge.</td>', 'Loved the picture. Very good animal shot.  However, the decision is lost on me.  Don''t see a connection to the challenge.', '2005-06-07 16:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1439143, 182028, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  The colors are very vibrant, but the contrast could have been better.  Focus was a little off as well.</td>', 'Very cute.  The colors are very vibrant, but the contrast could have been better.  Focus was a little off as well.', '2005-06-07 16:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1439150, 181995, 35602, '<td valign="top">Really liked the detail of the head in conjunction with the motion of the coin.  As a black and white, the glints are good and the contrast of the ribbing along the coin edge is good too.  You did a nice job on this one.</td>', 'Really liked the detail of the head in conjunction with the motion of the coin.  As a black and white, the glints are good and the contrast of the ribbing along the coin edge is good too.  You did a nice job on this one.', '2005-06-07 16:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1439152, 183147, 35602, '<td valign="top">Good conveyance of a decision.  Great detail, and the person stands out enough without overwhelming the photo.  Well placed in conjunction with the rest of the picture.</td>', 'Good conveyance of a decision.  Great detail, and the person stands out enough without overwhelming the photo.  Well placed in conjunction with the rest of the picture.', '2005-06-07 16:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
