(1439523, 182258, 5792, '<td valign="top">One of the best images entered in this challenge with ribbon potential, but I am sure some folks will vote it lower because of your title. "Go back?" probably would score better. High key look works well with this image.</td>', 'One of the best images entered in this challenge with ribbon potential, but I am sure some folks will vote it lower because of your title. "Go back?" probably would score better. High key look works well with this image.', '2005-06-07 21:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1439528, 183440, 5792, '<td valign="top">Tough subject but excellently captured. Should be a top three finisher. Making this a silhuoette emphasizes the harshness and incomprehensible nature of suicide.  Having the noose as the only item in sharp focus is ominously perfect. The only thing I might do different would be to keep the framing as is, but crop out a little more of the black border and leave just one side thick. Great job!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-06-08 05:11:21.</i></td>', 'Tough subject but excellently captured. Should be a top three finisher. Making this a silhuoette emphasizes the harshness and incomprehensible nature of suicide.  Having the noose as the only item in sharp focus is ominously perfect. The only thing I might do different would be to keep the framing as is, but crop out a little more of the black border and leave just one side thick. Great job!', '2005-06-07 21:50:23.000000', '2005-06-08 06:11:21.000000', 1),
(1439529, 182841, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, capture, action, background and high technical quality are all there. This has ribbon potential.</td>', 'Good lighting, capture, action, background and high technical quality are all there. This has ribbon potential.', '2005-06-07 21:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1439537, 182739, 5792, '<td valign="top">An excellent, haunting, emotional image and one of the best of the challenge. Makes the viewer wonder why she is going away since clearly she seems conflicted about it. The only thing hurting it is the shadow reflection on the left side, the reflection of the car. The metal seatbelt near her fingertip is distracting. Super facial capture. Kudos to you for a great shot.</td>', 'An excellent, haunting, emotional image and one of the best of the challenge. Makes the viewer wonder why she is going away since clearly she seems conflicted about it. The only thing hurting it is the shadow reflection on the left side, the reflection of the car. The metal seatbelt near her fingertip is distracting. Super facial capture. Kudos to you for a great shot.', '2005-06-07 21:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
