(1439588, 183439, 19978, '<td valign="top">White queen should be on a white square - board is oriented incorrectly. Sorry but that''s a deduction. Technically an OK photo but something is keeping it back from being dramatic. Maybe I just can''t get past that darn queen on the dark square....uurgh!</td>', 'White queen should be on a white square - board is oriented incorrectly. Sorry but that''s a deduction. Technically an OK photo but something is keeping it back from being dramatic. Maybe I just can''t get past that darn queen on the dark square....uurgh!', '2005-06-07 22:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
