(1439885, 183439, 33899, '<td valign="top">hey thanks ofr the comments everyone!  i know the white queen should be placed on the white space because i play chess a lot and ironically a friend actually asked me if it was supposed to be the other way around while i was starting to set it up.  but somehow i still got it wrong...aye all those years of middle school chess tournaments failed me, such a nerd such a nerd</td>', 'hey thanks ofr the comments everyone!  i know the white queen should be placed on the white space because i play chess a lot and ironically a friend actually asked me if it was supposed to be the other way around while i was starting to set it up.  but somehow i still got it wrong...aye all those years of middle school chess tournaments failed me, such a nerd such a nerd', '2005-06-08 01:03:03.000000', NULL, 0),
