(1439940, 183851, 38019, '<td valign="top">Everyone doubted, what does "Which One??" refers to the theme "Decision"<br/> <br/>Very well, I caught this snap at the zoo, where this mother duck just stood up to reposition her eggs. So the "Which One" means she to decide to start from which one among the three eggs.<br/> <br/>I hope now you think that it suits the theme.<br/> <br/>I received 310 votes but only 8 comments. :( <br/>Would like your comments to help me for my future work.</td>', 'Everyone doubted, what does "Which One??" refers to the theme "Decision" Very well, I caught this snap at the zoo, where this mother duck just stood up to reposition her eggs. So the "Which One" means she to decide to start from which one among the three eggs. I hope now you think that it suits the theme. I received 310 votes but only 8 comments. :( Would like your comments to help me for my future work.', '2005-06-08 01:14:19.000000', NULL, 0),
