(1440025, 184214, 17203, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tyt2000:</b></div><hr/><i>...the hand gave it away.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>LOL- if you hadn''t made me so darn self-conscious about having hands in my shots, my last entry (True Grit) would have had one, too. ;-P</td>', 'Originally posted by tyt2000:...the hand gave it away.  LOL- if you hadn''t made me so darn self-conscious about having hands in my shots, my last entry (True Grit) would have had one, too. ;-P', '2005-06-08 01:37:44.000000', NULL, 0),
