(1440033, 184226, 17203, '<td valign="top">12th is pretty darn good, but I expected a ribbon on this one. Few images are powerful enough to make the top 15 with that many ones and twos.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-06-08 00:41:57.</i></td>', '12th is pretty darn good, but I expected a ribbon on this one. Few images are powerful enough to make the top 15 with that many ones and twos.', '2005-06-08 01:40:00.000000', '2005-06-08 01:41:57.000000', 0),
(1440034, 183731, 34247, '<td valign="top">Strong reaction provoked, and that''s a good thing. The image "quality" I''d say is much better than 92. I don''t think I''m alone in thinking this, and the folks who rated this higher than 7 or 8 would agree. It''s too bad there were also plenty of people who obviously were either BLIND or couldn''t get passed their own filters to see the image as a good image, and the topic as a provoking but VALID topic.</td>', 'Strong reaction provoked, and that''s a good thing. The image "quality" I''d say is much better than 92. I don''t think I''m alone in thinking this, and the folks who rated this higher than 7 or 8 would agree. It''s too bad there were also plenty of people who obviously were either BLIND or couldn''t get passed their own filters to see the image as a good image, and the topic as a provoking but VALID topic.', '2005-06-08 01:41:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(1440039, 181996, 37005, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Cody28:</b></div><hr/><i> Good idea, but since when would a girl have fingernails like this?  Really detracts from the photo as it''s all I focus on. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Dude, it''s a little kid''s fingernails.  That''s my daughter''s hand.</td>', 'Originally posted by Cody28: Good idea, but since when would a girl have fingernails like this?  Really detracts from the photo as it''s all I focus on.   Dude, it''s a little kid''s fingernails.  That''s my daughter''s hand.', '2005-06-08 01:43:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(1440040, 183937, 30817, '<td valign="top">Well, Gladys ... it just goes to prove that one person''s "perfect 10" is another''s 2. To those who commented that this is too dark, I must ask; what do you want to see here that you are unable to see? Many people get confused about enjoining photos. One must judge too dark by the brightest point in the image, not the darkest. If this were lightened, the bright spots would explode beyond distracting. While certainly cool by tones, this is a very acceptable exposure that literally aids to put the viewer into a quiet, deep woods where they belong, in order to engage the photographer emotionally at the precise instant the shutter was tripped. This is not the beach. This is not joyous frolicing in sunshine. This is deeply thoughtful and contemplative, exactly where decisions dwell.</td>', 'Well, Gladys ... it just goes to prove that one person''s "perfect 10" is another''s 2. To those who commented that this is too dark, I must ask; what do you want to see here that you are unable to see? Many people get confused about enjoining photos. One must judge too dark by the brightest point in the image, not the darkest. If this were lightened, the bright spots would explode beyond distracting. While certainly cool by tones, this is a very acceptable exposure that literally aids to put the viewer into a quiet, deep woods where they belong, in order to engage the photographer emotionally at the precise instant the shutter was tripped. This is not the beach. This is not joyous frolicing in sunshine. This is deeply thoughtful and contemplative, exactly where decisions dwell.', '2005-06-08 01:43:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(1440047, 184149, 17203, '<td valign="top">This has absolutely NOTHING to do with a decision. Zip, zero, zilch, nada- WWYT?<br/> <br/>...and straight into my favorites it goes. ;-)</td>', 'This has absolutely NOTHING to do with a decision. Zip, zero, zilch, nada- WWYT? ...and straight into my favorites it goes. ;-)', '2005-06-08 01:45:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1440055, 182919, 16230, '<td valign="top">Great job Robert! Congrats!</td>', 'Great job Robert! Congrats!', '2005-06-08 01:49:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(1440065, 184226, 31214, '<td valign="top">Great photo...easily the best of this challenge!  Congrats.</td>', 'Great photo...easily the best of this challenge!  Congrats.', '2005-06-08 01:53:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(1440075, 184180, 8891, '<td valign="top">Big congrats on another ribbon, BC. Great shot and excellent tones.</td>', 'Big congrats on another ribbon, BC. Great shot and excellent tones.', '2005-06-08 01:59:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(1440077, 182837, 6999, '<td valign="top">Many congratulations on achieving a really rare feat ... ain''t it nice when things just work?</td>', 'Many congratulations on achieving a really rare feat ... ain''t it nice when things just work?', '2005-06-08 01:59:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(1440099, 184151, 20462, '<td valign="top">This was my favorite in the challenge.  Composition, story, lighting, all there.  Keep it up.</td>', 'This was my favorite in the challenge.  Composition, story, lighting, all there.  Keep it up.', '2005-06-08 02:11:42.000000', NULL, 0),
