(1441044, 182120, 27440, '<td valign="top">32 ones ! 19 twos 35 threes !!!<br/>Horrbile voting. People are soooo strange. Who gave this a 1 ? I would like this person to justify why why why? I think it''s good because it shows the whole thing in a subtle way. Do you people think that if you put a 1 here you are a better person because you "did something " to stop it?<br/> <br/>Cheers Infuriated insane.</td>', '32 ones ! 19 twos 35 threes !!!Horrbile voting. People are soooo strange. Who gave this a 1 ? I would like this person to justify why why why? I think it''s good because it shows the whole thing in a subtle way. Do you people think that if you put a 1 here you are a better person because you "did something " to stop it? Cheers Infuriated insane.', '2005-06-08 13:27:58.000000', NULL, 0),
