(1441648, 182739, 19746, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, fantastic blue tones.  A couple of big problems with this shot...<br/> <br/>1)  Photographers reflection is always difficult to eradicate but can really detract from the shot.<br/>2)  The seatbelt is reflecting a lot of light from outside and is a somewhat distracting element in this shot.<br/> <br/>Apart from that, I love the idea (although there was an entry very similar to this in a recent challenge).  Nice Iron Maiden t-shirt ;)<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'This is a great shot, fantastic blue tones.  A couple of big problems with this shot... 1)  Photographers reflection is always difficult to eradicate but can really detract from the shot.2)  The seatbelt is reflecting a lot of light from outside and is a somewhat distracting element in this shot. Apart from that, I love the idea (although there was an entry very similar to this in a recent challenge).  Nice Iron Maiden t-shirt ;) Alex', '2005-06-08 16:54:33.000000', NULL, 0),
