(1442548, 183791, 36095, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ladymonarda:</b></div><hr/><i> In your editing program, I think a little better focus would have strengthened the image.  Maybe more cropping from the top and sides would have added a better dimension to the subject of the boy.  The contrast of red amongst the green, though, really works. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Originally posted by ladymonarda: In your editing program, I think a little better focus would have strengthened the image.  Maybe more cropping from the top and sides would have added a better dimension to the subject of the boy.  The contrast of red amongst the green, though, really works. ', '2005-06-08 22:39:01.000000', NULL, 0),
