(1481721, 182878, 16488, '<td valign="top">A worthy shot...worthy of more than a perfect 5.000!<br/>There''s so much going on here!  The scores, the expression, the diagonals in the field, the inclusion of the fans! all lend to the moment.  Do people think these are "easy" shots to get?  I hereby deem you a victim of the challenge topic....</td>', 'A worthy shot...worthy of more than a perfect 5.000!There''s so much going on here!  The scores, the expression, the diagonals in the field, the inclusion of the fans! all lend to the moment.  Do people think these are "easy" shots to get?  I hereby deem you a victim of the challenge topic....', '2005-06-24 17:45:09.000000', NULL, 0),
