(1770023, 183810, 41200, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Simple white background was definitely the way to go. If the bugs don''t cooperate, throw them in the fridge. Just pull the one you want to move out a little earlier.</td>', 'Nice image. Simple white background was definitely the way to go. If the bugs don''t cooperate, throw them in the fridge. Just pull the one you want to move out a little earlier.', '2005-10-08 13:47:58.000000', NULL, 0),
